OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in hospital after three
OL,4,Avehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 80s has died in hospital
OL,7,Fdays after a crash involving three
OL,8,Fvehicles, Dorset Police said.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Fcrash involving a grey Skoda Karoq, a
OL,12,Fred and black Toyota C-HR and a blue
OL,13,FKia Picanto in Old Sherborne Road at
OL,14,FGales Hill, near Buckland Newton, at
OL,15,Fabout 12:20 GMT on Sunday.
OL,17,FThe force said that the occupants of
OL,18,Fthe Kia, a man and woman in their 80s,
OL,19,Fwere seriously injured and taken to
OL,20,Fhospital, where the man died on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
